skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

title Arquitecturas de Atención — MLA vs MLA+DSA
left to right direction

rectangle &quot;Kimi K2.6 — MLA puro&quot; as MLA #FFCDD2 {
  rectangle &quot;KV Cache
^^^^^
